        "start": 50.67,
        "end": 55.187,
        "text": "比如说睡眠时长，还有哪里觉得不舒服等等，也就说我白天全靠咖啡撑着",
        "representativeTime": 52.928,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-027",
          "SHOT-028",
          "SHOT-029",
          "SHOT-030",
          "SHOT-031",
          "SHOT-032"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-017",
        "start": 55.187,
        "end": 58.78,
        "text": "他会追问一天大概喝多少杯，再告诉我不加量就行",
        "representativeTime": 56.983,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-032",
          "SHOT-033",
          "SHOT-034",
          "SHOT-035",
          "SHOT-036",
          "SHOT-037",
          "SHOT-038"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-018",
        "start": 58.79,
        "end": 63.303,
        "text": "女生嘛，都想做好身材管理，我跟她说完自己的体重啊，身高啊等信息",
        "representativeTime": 61.046,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-018.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-038",
          "SHOT-039"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-019",
        "start": 63.303,
        "end": 68.56,
        "text": "她还会确认我平时的运动频率啊，饮食习惯啊什么的，再告诉我需要增加力量训练",
        "representativeTime": 65.931,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-019.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-039"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-020",
        "start": 68.57,
        "end": 73.73,
        "text": "饮食怎么搭配等等，这种体验跟平时去网站解锁信息完全不一样，大家都知道",
        "representativeTime": 71.15,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-039",
          "SHOT-040"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-021",
        "start": 73.74,
        "end": 77.534,
        "text": "健康相关的咨询没有标准答案，把问题一步步的梳理清楚",
        "representativeTime": 75.637,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-021.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-040"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-022",
        "start": 77.534,
        "end": 82.26,
        "text": "还有一些以前想要坚持但又总是断掉的小目标，我们也可以用它来记录",
        "representativeTime": 79.897,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-022.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-040",
          "SHOT-041"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-023",
        "start": 82.27,
        "end": 86.91,
        "text": "比如坚持十二点前睡觉，睡觉前五分钟放松冥想，你看他不会催你",
        "representativeTime": 84.59,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-023.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-041",
          "SHOT-042"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-024",
        "start": 86.91,
        "end": 89.5,
        "text": "只是想让你意识到。你已经在慢慢的变好",
        "representativeTime": 88.205,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-024.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-042",
          "SHOT-043"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-025",
        "start": 89.5,
        "end": 93.66,
        "text": "阿福之所以这么客气，是因为他一直在用很高的专业标准在做健康管理",
        "representativeTime": 91.58,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-025.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-043",
          "SHOT-044",
          "SHOT-045",
          "SHOT-046",
          "SHOT-047",
          "SHOT-048",
          "SHOT-049",
          "SHOT-050",
          "SHOT-051",
          "SHOT-052",
          "SHOT-053",
          "SHOT-054",
          "SHOT-055",
          "SHOT-056"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-026",
        "start": 93.66,
        "end": 96.5,
        "text": "只是提供参考，绝不制造恐慌，一整个靠谱",
        "representativeTime": 95.08,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-026.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-056",
          "SHOT-057"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-027",
        "start": 96.51,
        "end": 101.19,
        "text": "我们这一代的打工人真正缺的就是这样一个能够看见你，也能够真正回应你",
        "representativeTime": 98.85,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-027.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-057",
          "SHOT-058"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-028",
        "start": 101.19,
        "end": 105.6,
        "text": "并且能够完全确保你隐私的健康，搭子，你最想问的一个健康的问题是什么？",
        "representativeTime": 103.395,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-028.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-058"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
